# Mobile store shot: the main menu in the touch layout. A tap (the
# authentic dismissal) clears the TAP TO START attract screen. Render
# with NEWTONIA_FORCE_TOUCH=1 (mobile.sh does) and a NETPLAY build so
# the ONLINE/LEADERBOARD rows show as they do in the shipped apps.
seed 3
menu
sim 1200
tap 0.5 0.4 300
